{"title":"Career roadmap · Heritage Tour Manager","role":"Heritage Tour Manager","summary":"A Heritage Tour Manager plans, coordinates, and delivers tourism experiences centred on historical sites, monuments, museums, archaeological locations, cultural landscapes, traditional communities, architecture, art, food, and intangible cultural heritage.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career alignment"},{"type":"p","text":"A Heritage Tour Manager plans, coordinates, and delivers tourism experiences centred on historical sites, monuments, museums, archaeological locations, cultural landscapes, traditional communities, architecture, art, food, and intangible cultural heritage."},{"type":"p","text":"A BA in Tourism & Hospitality Studies provides the tourism and hospitality foundation. To specialise in heritage tourism, students should add Indian history, archaeology, heritage conservation awareness, destination management, storytelling, tour operations, digital mapping, sustainability, and visitor experience design."},{"type":"note","label":"Important distinction","text":"A Heritage Tour Manager manages the tour/product and visitor experience. This is different from a licensed/authorised tourist guide, where applicable, or an archaeologist/conservation professional, which may have separate qualification or institutional requirements."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical Roles"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"Tourism Intern, Heritage Tourism Intern, Tour Coordinator"}],[{"text":"Early Career"},{"text":"Heritage Tour Executive, Tour Executive, Heritage Experience Executive"}],[{"text":"Mid Career"},{"text":"Heritage Tour Manager, Senior Tour Manager, Destination Manager"}],[{"text":"Advanced"},{"text":"Heritage Tourism Manager, Destination Experience Manager"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Head of Heritage Touri